{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124159","id":4737465502,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGl_8ng","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124159","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124159.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124159.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124159","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124159/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124159/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124159/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6aa9561d58d038d02a9e3f4e0022bebce46eebff","number":124159,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add configurable cursor shapes for drag-and-drop interactions","user":{"login":"MatthiasBae","id":52577744,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNTc3NzQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52577744?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae","html_url":"https://github.com/MatthiasBae","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15611\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n# Implementation (new)\r\n\r\nInstead of my proposed changes to set a CursorShape, I decided to set custom textures as cursors.\r\n\r\nEvery Control Node now has a new Inspector Group\r\n<img width=\"539\" height=\"252\" alt=\"godot windows editor dev x86_64_D0JJrWeM2k\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/82244888-c3d2-4db7-bce2-31af662c4934\" />\r\n\r\nIn case the default drag & drop is implemented it now checks the hovered control if the custom drag & drop group is enabled. \r\n\r\nIn case it is it takes the given textures from the hovered control and changes the Mouse Cursor via the DisplayServer.\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d5cc004-1925-4db5-a059-ac7fdd5dda70\r\n\r\n\r\n_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________\r\n# Implementation (old)\r\n\r\nIn the Proposal I made two suggestions. I decided for being able to set the CursorShape per hovered Node.\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ccb3e57-d0a7-402e-bd7b-9994f2ad1463\r\n\r\nI was also thinking of if it might sense to use custom textures instead of CursorShape but I might need time and make a separate PR for this\r\n\r\n<b>TestProject</b>\r\n\r\n[DragDropPr.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33035862/DragDropPr.zip)\r\n\r\n**No AI has been used**\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/